<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="zh-Hant">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
  <title>Medical Case Library</title>

  <style>
    body {
      margin: 0;
      font-family: Arial, "Microsoft JhengHei", sans-serif;
      background: white;
      color: #222;
    }

    header {
      background: #f4f7fb;
      padding: 40px 20px;
      text-align: center;
      border-bottom: 1px solid #ddd;
    }

    header h1 {
      margin: 0;
      font-size: 36px;
    }

    header p {
      color: #666;
      margin-top: 10px;
    }

    .container {
      max-width: 1000px;
      margin: 40px auto;
      padding: 0 20px;
    }

    .section-title {
      font-size: 26px;
      margin-bottom: 20px;
    }

    .grid {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(220px, 1fr));
      gap: 18px;
    }

    .card {
      border: 1px solid #ddd;
      border-radius: 12px;
      padding: 22px;
      background: white;
      text-decoration: none;
      color: #222;
      transition: 0.2s;
    }

    .card:hover {
      transform: translateY(-4px);
      box-shadow: 0 6px 18px rgba(0,0,0,0.1);
    }

    .card h2 {
      margin-top: 0;
      font-size: 21px;
    }

    .card p {
      color: #666;
      margin-bottom: 0;
    }

    footer {
      text-align: center;
      padding: 30px;
      color: #888;
      font-size: 14px;
    }
  </style>
</head>

<body>

  <header>
    <h1>Medical Case Library</h1>
    <p>醫學病例學習資料庫</p>
  </header>

  <div class="container">

    <h2 class="section-title">病例分類</h2>

    <div class="grid">

      <a class="card" href="#">
        <h2>❤️ Cardiology</h2>
        <p>心臟與心血管疾病病例</p>
      </a>

      <a class="card" href="#">
        <h2>🧠 Neurology</h2>
        <p>神經系統疾病病例</p>
      </a>

      <a class="card" href="#">
        <h2>🫁 Pulmonology</h2>
        <p>肺部與呼吸系統病例</p>
      </a>

      <a class="card" href="#">
        <h2>🩺 Gastroenterology</h2>
        <p>腸胃與肝膽疾病病例</p>
      </a>

      <a class="card" href="#">
        <h2>💧 Nephrology</h2>
        <p>腎臟與泌尿系統病例</p>
      </a>

      <a class="card" href="#">
        <h2>🧪 Endocrinology</h2>
        <p>內分泌與代謝疾病病例</p>
      </a>

      <a class="card" href="#">
        <h2>🦠 Infectious Disease</h2>
        <p>感染症病例</p>
      </a>

      <a class="card" href="#">
        <h2>📁 All Cases</h2>
        <p>查看全部病例</p>
      </a>

    </div>

  </div>

  <footer>
    Medical Case Library
  </footer>

</body>
</html>
